# This repository is a Unity package, not a Unity project — there is no
# Library/, Temp/ or build output to ignore. Keep .meta files: Unity needs
# them, and dropping one regenerates a fresh GUID that breaks references.

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
# ...but a trailing ~ is how UPM marks a folder Unity must not import, so those
# are real content here and must not be caught by the rule above.
!Tools~/
!Documentation~/
!Samples~/

# IDE
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
